---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Review a Story and Create Narration"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Parent
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as :StoriesRoutes
  participant C as :StoriesController
  participant ES as :StoriesEditorService
  participant NS as :StoriesNarrationService
  participant NST as :StoriesNarrationStore
  participant Q as :NarrationQueue
  participant P as :NarrationProcessor
  participant AI as :AiClient
  participant DB as Database
  participant AIS as AI Service
  participant CD as Cloudinary

  Note over U,CD: 1. Review (mark story as finished)
  U->>W: Click Finish story
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/stories/:id/review
  R->>C: reviewStory(req, res)
  C->>ES: reviewStory(user, storyId)
  ES->>DB: BEGIN, lock story row (owner, not generating)
  ES->>DB: SELECT pages, checkpoints, options
  ES->>ES: findReviewGaps(pages, checkpoints)
  alt empty page / question / option left
    ES-->>C: ApiError 422 (list of gaps)
    C-->>W: 422 Story is not finished
  else no gaps
    ES->>DB: check blocked keywords on whole story
    alt blocked keyword
      ES-->>C: ApiError 422
      C-->>W: 422 Unsuitable words
    else ok
      ES->>DB: UPDATE stories SET reviewedAt, status
      ES->>NS: prepareNarration(tx, storyId)
      opt story.useTts
        NS->>NST: queueNarration(tx, storyId, voice)
        NST->>DB: SELECT tts.voice, existing narration_clips
        NST->>NST: split into segments, fingerprint = hash(text + voice)
        NST->>DB: INSERT / UPDATE narration_clips (queued, round + 1) for new or changed segments
        NST-->>NS: clip jobs
      end
      ES->>DB: COMMIT
      ES->>NS: dispatchNarration(jobs)
      NS->>Q: enqueueNarration(jobs)
      alt enqueue fails
        NS->>NST: failClip(ENQUEUE_FAILED) for each job
      end
      ES-->>C: story detail + narration progress
      C-->>W: 200 reviewed story
    end
  end

  Note over U,CD: 2. Worker reads each segment (one job at a time)
  loop each clip job
    Q->>P: processNarrationJob(clipId, round)
    P->>NST: markClipGenerating(clipId, round)
    P->>NST: loadClipInput(clipId)
    alt text changed since queued (round mismatch)
      P->>NST: failClip(STALE)
    else current
      P->>AI: callAi(narration, text, voice)
      AI->>AIS: POST /v1/tts/synthesize
      AIS->>CD: upload audio file
      CD-->>AIS: audio key
      AIS-->>AI: audio_key, duration
      alt success
        P->>NST: persistClip(clip, audioKey)
        NST->>DB: narration_clips ready, write audioKey to page / question / hint / option
      else TTS error after retries
        P->>NST: failClip(code, message)
        NST->>DB: narration_clips failed
      end
    end
  end

  Note over U,CD: 3. Retry failed narration
  U->>W: Click Retry narration
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/stories/:id/narration/retry
  R->>C: retryNarration(req, res)
  C->>NS: retryNarration(user, storyId)
  NS->>DB: BEGIN, lock story row
  alt not reviewed / TTS turned off
    NS-->>C: ApiError 422
    C-->>W: 422 Finish the story first / narration is off
  else ok
    NS->>NST: queueNarration (only failed / missing / changed segments)
    NS->>DB: COMMIT
    NS->>Q: enqueueNarration(jobs)
    alt enqueue fails
      NS-->>C: ApiError 503
      C-->>W: 503 Narration service unavailable
    else queued
      NS-->>C: story detail
      C-->>W: 200 narration re-queued
    end
  end
